flowchart TD
    Event([Trigger Event]) --> NS[NotificationService]
    NS --> Pref{Check User\nPreferences}
    Pref -->|InApp enabled| InApp[Create Notification\nin DB]
    Pref -->|Email enabled| Email[Send via Brevo]
    Pref -->|Push enabled| Push{User has\npush subscription?}
    
    Push -->|Yes| SendPush[Send Web Push]
    Push -->|No| Skip[Skip push]
    
    InApp --> Display[Display in\nNavbar Bell]
    Email --> Inbox[User's Email]
    SendPush --> Browser[Browser\nNotification]

